# Optional: pre-fill the Gemini API key at build time so users don't have to
# paste one in on first load. Get a free key from https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#
# Never commit a real key. If you set this for a deployed build, remember the
# key ships to the client bundle — fine for personal/local use, but for a
# multi-user deployment proxy requests through your own backend instead.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
